      crates/orca-config/src/value.rs        (src/libslic3r/Config.hpp, src/libslic3r/Config.cpp)
      crates/orca-config/src/legacy.rs       (src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp)
      crates/orca-config/src/def_generated.rs (src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp, src/libslic3r/Preset.cpp,
                                              generated from the configdef probe)
    On 2026-11-07 phase O2 added ten crates (orca-eigen, orca-geom, orca-exact, orca-qhull,
    orca-mesh, orca-zip, orca-xml, orca-placeholder, orca-arrange and orca-model), each described,
